issions for the selected destination, then Lambda will attempt to add the permissions to the role.","permissions.editMonitoringTools.body.description":"For more information about required permissions, see the {xrayLink}, {lambdaInsightsLink}, and {codeGuruLink} documentation.","permissions.editMonitoringTools.body.description.xray":"X-Ray","permissions.editMonitoringTools.body.description.lambdaInsights":"Lambda Insights","permissions.editMonitoringTools.body.description.codeGuru":"CodeGuru Profiler","permissions.editDestination.body.description":"For more information about required permissions, see the {externalLink} documentation.","permissions.editDestination.body.description.destinations":"Destinations","permissions.body.header":"Add required permissions","permissions.alert.error":"Your IAM entity doesn't have permission to modify the execution role. To request permission, contact your AWS administrator.","functionDetail.sections.rdsDBSection.title":"RDS database connections","rdsresources.section.missingVpc.title":"Function not connected to a VPC","rdsresources.section.missingVpc.description":"When a function is not connected to a VPC, the following table will be empty. You can configure a VPC separately or when connecting to an RDS database.","rdsresources.table.description":"The following table shows databases that match this function's VPC and security group. Review the details to confirm a connection.","rdsresources.table.header.name":"DB identifier","rdsresources.table.header.endpoint":"Endpoint","rdsresources.table.header.proxy":"Proxy identifier","rdsresources.table.header.lambdasec":"Lambda security group","rdsresources.table.header.rdssec":"DB security group","rdsresources.table.rds.connect":"Connect to RDS database","addRdsDatabase.add.submit":"Create","rdsdatabase.form.header":"RDS database","addRdsDatabase.existingEndpointDB.field.label":"RDS database","rdsdatabase.form.description.hasvpc":"Connect {functionName} attached to <link> {vpcId} </link> {