ctions","titleEvent":"Lambda Event"}},"header":{"title":"Lambda offerings"},"microVM":{"description":"Build applications that safely execute untrusted code with strong isolation and fast startup times. Supports long-running environments with persistent state.","header":{"action":"Start a microVM","title":"Lambda microVMs"}},"web":{"description":"Build and deploy Web applications directly on Lambda with built-in endpoints and simplified configuration.","header":{"action":"Create a Web Function","title":"Lambda Web"}}},"pricing":{"disclaimer":"Pricing may vary by region. See <1>AWS Lambda Pricing</1> for more information. Use the <3>AWS Pricing Calculator</3> to estimate costs for your use case."},"quickstart":{"codeStorage":{"label":"Code storage"},"functionCount":{"label":"Lambda function(s)"},"new":{"blurb":"Bring your own code, or choose a ready-to-deploy example.","createEventFunction":"Create an Event Function","createFunction":"Create a function","createWebFunction":"Create a Web Function","startMicroVM":"Start a microVM"},"newEventFunction":{"header":"Lambda Event"},"returning":{"header":"Your functions"},"returningEventFunction":{"buttonText":"Manage Event Functions"}}},"cancel":"Cancel","canvas":{"placeholder":"Welcome to the canvas! Use ⌘⇧K to get started."},"close":"Close","codeEditor":{"editorWithCursor":"{{editorName}} editor, cursor at row {{row}}"},"confirm":"confirm","copied":"Copied","createApplicationDiscover":{"composer":{"blurb":"Infrastructure Composer is a visual editor for building applications with AWS services, using a simple drag and drop workflow that automatically generates the necessary configuration to deploy your application. Infrastructure Composer is based on the AWS Serverless Application Model.","features":{"feature1":"Use side-by-side with your IDE of choice","feature2":"Organize resources into groups","feature3":"Generate a deployment-ready AWS SAM template","header":"Features"},"getStarted":{"buttonText":"Get started"},"header":{